// ENSURE closures follow NEVER pairs transitively: forcing fan ON forces heater OFF, which in
// turn forces vent ON (W107 lists the whole chain).
SENSOR   temp   AT A0 ANALOG UNIT C RANGE -40..125;
ACTUATOR fan    AT D7;
ACTUATOR heater AT D8;
ACTUATOR vent   AT D9;

RULE cool:   WHEN temp > 35 THEN fan ON;
RULE uncool: WHEN temp < 30 THEN fan OFF;
RULE warm:   WHEN temp < 10 THEN heater ON;
RULE unwarm: WHEN temp > 15 THEN heater OFF;
RULE air:    WHEN temp > 25 THEN vent ON;
RULE still:  WHEN temp < 20 THEN vent OFF;

SAFETY NEVER fan ON AND heater ON;
SAFETY NEVER heater OFF AND vent OFF;
SAFETY ENSURE fan ON WHEN temp > 50;
FAILSAFE heater ON;
